{\b Upgrading from an older version:} older versions of ClearPods needed Windows Test Mode and Secure Boot off. Setup offers to turn Test Mode off and suggests turning Secure Boot back on. Have your BitLocker recovery key ready, because Windows may ask for it after these changes.\par
You do this at your own risk. ClearPods comes with no warranty, as described in the no-warranty and liability terms below.\par
